{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "d38883bc10073a007acfd2ae70943117af2a292feb5c815d7a0d1d51adefbaef", "ja": "胸に抱いた、小さな星", "zh": "怀抱心中的小小星芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "44a177ca1bb9ace6453ae61640e4bf4a5ba255c8b677596e1412bec185547b0b", "ja": "自分にとって歌とは？　悩むあずさは貴音に\n相談するが、いつの間にか貴音の悩みを解決\nしてしまっていた。その後、千早達のレッス\nンを眺めているうちに、あずさは、昔は自分\nも純粋に歌を楽しんでいた事を思い出す。", "zh": "对自己来说，歌究竟意味着什么？烦恼中的茱莎向贵音请教，却不知不觉间解决了贵音的烦恼。之后，在旁观千早她们练习的过程中，茱莎想起自己过去也曾纯粹地享受歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b7254f765a527c72e1ac3abe25d5694a0432cc9e388fa899758d6884b8fc652", "ja": "（仕事の後、あずささんと一緒に劇場に戻ると貴音が\nコラムに悩んでいた。ちょうどいいタイミングだな）", "zh": "（工作结束后，和梓小姐一起回到剧场，正好碰到贵音在为专栏发愁。时机刚刚好啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "75351e1aa85215a4e8d13c459d39b62c16274005ee0cebf187129bec16fe10d7", "ja": "はあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "69c8854b1897663edaf620c91e486744ce1580329d24c0380fd9a595b00a82aa", "ja": "貴音ちゃん、お疲れさま。", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0ffcc1481659a94b1c378317d44568c0675ccb1384fd09354db2c6519eaa8116", "ja": "お疲れさま、貴音。\nその様子だと、コラム、苦戦してるみたいだな……。", "zh": "辛苦了，贵音。\n看你的样子，专栏好像写得不太顺利啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "aaf1ff8173fdbbd9fff42e8789a2562356cfd264ee52673de7c01b429a3edfa9", "ja": "あずさに、{$P$}。\nええ、少し悩んでいたところです。", "zh": "梓，{$P$}。\n是的，我刚才正有些烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "839f330cbfed9e1799d3a479af0ea1e28b80571359b9123c29cd986100349175", "ja": "実はちょっと、貴音ちゃんに相談したいことがあって。\n私も、コラムの原稿に悩んでいるの。", "zh": "其实我有点事想找贵音商量。\n我也在为专栏的原稿发愁呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "014ea852a3621d331f54ffe120d39862161fd6e486a1f78b6d38ca002d63edc6", "ja": "よかったら、相談に乗ってもらえないかしら？", "zh": "如果可以的话，能不能和我聊聊呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "18a3b8429a4eef065f3e2b2f4164646e32fe226de0678dc93c819c92a0bce667", "ja": "……。もちろんです。私達は同じユニットの仲間。\n喜んで相談に乗りましょう。", "zh": "……当然可以。我们是同一个组合的伙伴。\n我很乐意听你倾诉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "e7c0072435babf408bcd8d4c9479b389edc50bd99dab9257918a642e0979019e", "ja": "ありがとう、貴音ちゃん。\nそれじゃ、遠慮なく……。", "zh": "谢谢你，贵音。\n那我就不客气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "3dbf06384e44be79703d91f9188f8c6bab768a1954483f86f1ec1c84bc73c1e5", "ja": "貴音ちゃんは……歌に、何か\n特別な思い入れってあるのかしら？", "zh": "贵音……你对唱歌有什么特别的感情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "6de24560157ee285bc1636a507bcb7add2b93bfa0affbaf8889aeb82ea1c454e", "ja": "歌に、思い入れ……ですか？\nそうですね……。", "zh": "对于歌曲的特别感情……吗？\n是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "9f2cb639a728e2cc7a000a4a682c0a810f168116b25c0235745994d3bb6733ab", "ja": "私は、アイドルとして歌うことを……\n最初は、使命と思っていました。", "zh": "我最初认为，以偶像的身份唱歌……\n是一项使命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "6c128c302205af666086ae549289a5cf7f44e2afe7a1fb26e56eaad7552a74b4", "ja": "使命？", "zh": "使命？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "6473154983ad90350c9e836a111f184439bc645911e948b5e9e50402e0e072c0", "ja": "はい。私が歌う姿を人々に届けること……\nそれが私には、何よりも大切だったのです。", "zh": "是的。将我歌唱的身姿传达给人们……\n对我来说，那比什么都重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6c9fc9da20a0a2cc10919e1a887770a56aba240bc4ba9c55dc45c57c3b3f82eb", "ja": "（貴音……）", "zh": "（贵音……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "df5f9e5caf5f7b6e5dd6b98298df89bec8f7b9e3f582e9bfe986680fd8ef140e", "ja": "ですが、今はそれだけではありません。\n私の胸の奥に、確かに……あるのです。", "zh": "但是，现在还不止这些。\n在我的内心深处，确实……存在着什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "7a401c3b501c81e4c3d75f91a7e4a97c93425e11e47422491595c20e216b1a7a", "ja": "ただ歌を歌いたいと望む、私自身の気持ち……。\nそれが何かは、まだ言葉にはできないのですが。", "zh": "只是想唱歌的、属于我自己的心情……\n虽然还无法用语言说清那究竟是什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "cdf8b3e6f73ca8092dc651e1a4d98fb5ddfb8d5787225ac130b8e00463c3d07e", "ja": "ただそれは、私が歌い続けることで形になっていく。\nそんな気がいたします。", "zh": "只是，随着我不断歌唱，它会逐渐成形。\n我有这样的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "1d6bd13c915bef4d4504a94321e770b3668d5fa8fe0d8e121d6155c3b4db70e8", "ja": "歌うことで、形になるもの……。", "zh": "通过歌唱，逐渐成形的东西……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0788548df3285501fc26fa9e6e0a352e0a76ffb6fae148a1a8aeac58b3af5bab", "ja": "もしかしたら、それが歌に込められた『想い』とか……\nそういうものかもしれないな。", "zh": "也许，那就是蕴含在歌声中的“心意”……\n或者是类似的东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "63821fd84e74cb169c43d626e3805a3193c7835df0d5cc4354f52d6dcbd89615", "ja": "まあ……。そうですね。\n言葉にできないのは『想い』だからかもしれません。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n或许正因为那是无法用言语表达的“心意”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "e80304788cf320e04a199689fad1eb7bf88b72e918d1c8873aa5a6be8f3912cf", "ja": "歌い続ける者ならば、誰もが持つものなのでしょう。\n私には私の、千早には千早の……。", "zh": "只要是一直歌唱的人，或许每个人都拥有属于自己的那份心意吧。\n我有我的，千早也有千早的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1022_008tak", "source_sha256": "11880cec7bce3353c08a60ee2427c20939b318e54e043bc30e7d8ab1ee37ec4d", "ja": "そしてあずさには、あずさだけの想いが。\n歌いたいと願う……想いが、きっと。", "zh": "而あずさ也有着只属于她自己的想法。\n想要歌唱的……这份想法，一定也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "629fd698deb3450ac23c6bd604faf1e1f185c7f7e8ca298604cd132943fd1716", "ja": "私だけの想い……。", "zh": "只属于我的心意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "7d0c046b2c6323088004135a5edfbe850efaa3de175d438ff15c3b345811f29c", "ja": "いつもは歌で伝えている想い……。それを言葉に\nすることに、私は難儀しているのかもしれません。", "zh": "平常都是借由歌声传达的心意……\n或许我正为如何将其化作言语而感到为难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1d84bd18b16635d44b4946d6b392806f5dddb4aa4d6cac96facf875c979c98ef", "ja": "なるほど……そうだよな。説明するより、\n歌を聞いた方が早そうな気もするし……。", "zh": "原来如此……确实是这样。比起解释，\n直接听歌似乎更快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "5bd27f599e9a2a93e3b23a2f97fa50e2889c7dfd0a0fc1cb5c330b59acf61eea", "ja": "そうね……。\nでも貴音ちゃんなら、大丈夫かもしれない。", "zh": "是啊……\n不过，如果是贵音的话，说不定没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1027_008tak", "source_sha256": "48fe3e8ee593ca996f0e67867e29bb4ec381ff68411b0a935ac9ec8d1ffc4704", "ja": "あずさ……？", "zh": "阿梓……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "247fa7b83fcd3d3b8c15088af36faf9004a909d9f531d89789883eb1c8eb7dea", "ja": "あ、ごめんなさい。……ただ、ふと思ったんです。", "zh": "啊，对不起……只是突然想到了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "c56c981e576c82ccc0a7449470cce38ca3ef831e649118e0f2f3b0c115037996", "ja": "貴音ちゃんのファンの人達は、貴音ちゃんの言葉を、\nちゃんと受け止めてくれるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "我在想，贵音的粉丝们应该会好好理解贵音所说的话吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "c1c914a24f8092c93021980004abf0dd9619ac48fe8d577aff1340a77bef568c", "ja": "だから……難しく考えないで、心に浮かんだ言葉を\n書いてみると、いいんじゃないかしら……なんて。", "zh": "所以……别想得太复杂，试着把浮现在心里的话写下来，或许会比较好……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1031_008tak", "source_sha256": "83c3aa88a166154eafd27e8057f8ee167e00a2a24deef238189860982fc09943", "ja": "浮かんだ言葉を……そうですね。歌を歌うように、\n想いを込めた言葉を、紡いでゆけば……。", "zh": "浮现在脑海中的话语……说得也是。就像唱歌一样，把饱含心意的话语编织下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1032_008tak", "source_sha256": "1b16999061eae41458383527b29a987f594a60840547cc2288bdf37c2c79b098", "ja": "……ありがとうございます、あずさ。\n何やら、こらむの光明が見えて参りました。", "zh": "……谢谢您，梓。\n专栏的着落，似乎已经得见一丝曙光了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "4588ff4fe7582ff4c7072071e291b73b1fb0b20c57693c0b8fe1fc27364d4061", "ja": "はっ、いつの間にか貴音の悩みが解決することに……。\nあずささんは、どうですか？", "zh": "啊，不知不觉间，贵音的烦恼就要解决了……  \n话说，秋月小姐，你怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "63795aa1acb495f329d21cbb9d7698ae2f73cd86dc8df018755db166979b92f5", "ja": "ええ。少しだけですけど、\n私もわかってきたような気がします。", "zh": "嗯。虽然只是一点点，但我也感觉自己好像渐渐明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "e4210d6fba7c8dae126da2f3fcf9123acd9b1b6d772df189b9d6593740f47d78", "ja": "あっ！　あずささん、貴音さんも！\n千早さーん、ふたりとも控え室にいましたよー！", "zh": "啊！梓小姐，还有贵音小姐！\n千早姐——，她们两个人都在休息室里哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1036_002chi", "source_sha256": "d68c3c53758e426cb4f329bec1fe8a4926b79305b4abd94ec5e5a789c16ef79b", "ja": "あずささん、四条さん。\n{$P$}も、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "秋月小姐、四条小姐。\n{$P$}也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1037_002chi", "source_sha256": "54a4b3e76cd7e396504ba19bb1c8411554b3ebd9683b7ea7717bbf53221cab71", "ja": "これから、高槻さん達と歌のレッスンをするんです。\nよかったら、一緒にいかがですか？", "zh": "接下来要和高槻她们一起上歌唱课。\n如果不介意的话，要不要一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "847734c6b9d6d4956cf30cdb6449fec6f74579e56d019fed5e994939d079f52c", "ja": "レッスンか。コラムを書く前に、\n気分転換もいいかもしれませんね、あずささん。", "zh": "练习啊。在写专栏之前，换换心情或许也不错，あずさ。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "dbdb7aa1b1f149a6a630ce94cfd394df596ce2af7f608e75eb01c0e0b6162c8b", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね。それじゃ、みんなと一緒に\n千早ちゃんに教えてもらおうかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是呢。那我就和大家一起，\n请千早教教我们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1040_002chi", "source_sha256": "2986e982d149537c0aedd0b9301ca200a85150b79e2033505b329d3605f500dd", "ja": "えっ？　あずささんは、教える側では……？", "zh": "咦？　秋月姐姐不是负责教人的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1041_008tak", "source_sha256": "1404ded4f38bb349e013c5bbeb057ceabd3b8566f6ecd7929d672dffb9530b75", "ja": "良い機会です。千早の修練方法、私達も\nぜひ教えていただきましょう。ふふっ。", "zh": "这是个好机会。千早的修行方法，也请务必教教我们吧。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "6543ac0a90748d5345e53f18d9826c5e0dbcdabc3b6c05674942b4bf64981538", "ja": "そんな、四条さんまで……！　わ、わかりました。\nでは私なりに、できる限り……！", "zh": "怎么连四条小姐也……！我、我知道了。那就按我的方式，尽我所能……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "f686c8ca6ac845df1780c8752fd6a1243b96586bcd1375df02aa684bb5fd97ee", "ja": "（千早の歌声に続いて、やよい達が歌う。\nみんなの明るい声が、レッスン室に響き渡る……）", "zh": "（紧接着千早的歌声，弥生她们也唱了起来。\n大家明亮的歌声，在练习室里回荡……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "7dc2eb2fb440349a51605ce82e2c689af12d24409a329e83803653c8f8c22cb9", "ja": "めぐりめぐるように～♪\nまわれまわれ～、いのちよ～♪", "zh": "循环往复般～♪\n转起来吧，转起来吧——生命啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1045_005yay", "source_sha256": "6fdef75bd2f63263615fb81b5e5c44ac8df4edd637343864a072c4daee7afae0", "ja": "かくされたおもいは～♪\nしじまのさきの～♪", "zh": "隐藏的思念啊～♪\n寂静的彼方啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "3cf4131390019a7f6feccf2b2b209c9ae449a273bb0f6a79506216968cf40a81", "ja": "あの、千早さん！\n「しじま」って、どういう意味なんでしょう？", "zh": "那个，千早小姐！\n“しじま”是什么意思呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1047_002chi", "source_sha256": "e78d788856636416949b2d2912f531207c71daa495927f3656f59a79bbc82d52", "ja": "いい質問ね、箱崎さん。\nそれじゃ、歌詞の漢字を見てみましょうか。", "zh": "问得好，箱崎同学。\n那么，我们来看看歌词里的汉字吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1048_002chi", "source_sha256": "68e4842d78281aa19ccdd37fb6a3d484380880bb897f892c145376e02cbe2da0", "ja": "『静寂』……「静か」と「寂しい」という字を書くの。\n物音がひとつもしない、静かな状況を表す言葉よ。", "zh": "“寂静”……是由“寂静”和“寂寞”这两个字组成的。\n这是用来表示一点声音都没有、非常安静的状态的词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "5929defdeb4e1138a0903e068a367e1906f2833b3350bb09c0a532a580a8fa1f", "ja": "千早さん、すごーい！\nもしかして歌詞の言葉、全部調べてるんですか！？", "zh": "千早，太厉害了！\n难道歌词里的每个词你都查过了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1050_002chi", "source_sha256": "50b3dbfdb29a473d460ecd10261359aef915a62f073bb26fce704d2f95a3783c", "ja": "ええ。その方が、理解も深まるし……\n何より、心の中に入ってくるでしょう？", "zh": "是的。这样也能加深理解……\n最重要的是，也更容易唱进心里吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1051_022ser", "source_sha256": "fd614ff0e4fe9184a68a382288ae66878728188c37f57fd3163cd2a36713a372", "ja": "心の中に……。", "zh": "进到心里面……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1052_036kan", "source_sha256": "cafef7d7297a170af5c96028266670c3030c2ac7d7684e5e4b020a4a36d243a1", "ja": "わ、私も千早さんを見習って、\nこれからは歌詞の漢字を、調べて歌います！", "zh": "我、我也要向千早小姐学习，\n今后会先查好歌词里的汉字再去唱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1053_010azu", "source_sha256": "e6058aa5695949f8b2239bd1a313da2f8a9b817490ac6cea95548d44e28396a3", "ja": "ふふっ……。", "zh": "呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "89f4f158b589eae440f690c6e01ba795e4fa332d5ece7d99bba5545888b0f743", "ja": "あずささん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐，您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1055_010azu", "source_sha256": "507a70dfca0fa76c667dd89429a6d21d515697827ed2c62d13e7ae581021ee5f", "ja": "いえ。……私も昔は、みんなのように\n楽しく歌っていたことを、思い出したんです。", "zh": "不是的……我想起了自己以前也曾像大家一样，开心地唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1056_010azu", "source_sha256": "6416a6ed31936205bc4d06c6f2eb79e2e17931bf49049a106d7e8410c45256c0", "ja": "あの頃は、ただ歌うことが楽しくて……\n歌う理由を、考えたりはしませんでした。", "zh": "那时，我只是单纯觉得唱歌很开心……\n根本没去想过唱歌的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1057_010azu", "source_sha256": "5d0fa314c7367bba45bc21d832b64d8a2ab74d9e11dd3e944837097133f96061", "ja": "どうしてあんな風に歌えていたんだろうって……\n自分のことなのに、なんだか不思議です。", "zh": "明明是自己，却总觉得不可思议……那时候的我，究竟是为什么能那样歌唱呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "0b87c51aa8e3d96edc603c0fbfa3edddd6ff74786a3aa452ba2fad8c698cb5f1", "ja": "不思議じゃないと思いますよ。歌で想いが伝わるなら、\n楽しい気持ちも、広がっていくばかりでしょうから。", "zh": "我觉得这并不奇怪。既然能通过歌声传达心意，快乐的心情也只会不断扩散开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1059_p", "source_sha256": "97567ab168a159487fe6222cbdecdf9da8e05780d140018d101f6d9b8a0e86d3", "ja": "もしかしたら、それはあずささんにとって、\n当たり前だったのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "或许，这对梓小姐来说，\n也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1060_010azu", "source_sha256": "e911e6bc8de4e037530e53c6d82358eb4710b8ad0ad5a159199a8b3a0e494e68", "ja": "……当たり前の……？", "zh": "……理所当然的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1061_p", "source_sha256": "eadd213d981d1b69844ee9b4587b6f6e382838863415f1a94a334ab85b382a5c", "ja": "はい。楽しい気持ちはもちろん、幸せな気持ちとか、\n悲しい気持ちとか……優しい気持ちとか。", "zh": "是的。不仅是快乐的心情，还有幸福的心情、\n悲伤的心情……以及温柔的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1062_p", "source_sha256": "81b93240e64b43b3c46e295354e4120103499c20279aa5041e4174ae959bd5e5", "ja": "あずささんの歌には、伝える力がありますから。\n……間違いなく。", "zh": "因为梓小姐的歌声拥有传达情感的力量。\n……毫无疑问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1063_010azu", "source_sha256": "c5b0d1526d9a82304354f2c620b657671054a1142adcbf46d45630fded1e00fa", "ja": "あ……。{$P$}さん。\n私……なんとなく、わかった気がします。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n我……好像隐约明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1064_010azu", "source_sha256": "f2b4d529b6a1748aa3b0a13a6932876bfbbe6f4bc55f3b90a308b61df63bedcf", "ja": "私の中にある、歌への想い……\n私が歌いたいって思う気持ち。それは……。", "zh": "我心中对歌唱的感情……\n想要歌唱的心情。那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0114_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0114_story_05_1065_010azu", "source_sha256": "6c95f56d3532588b13a144fe0b1e50f482841b9a3b902b9fd4e1ee206fe8e458", "ja": "ただ、大好きな人たちに近づきたい。繋がりたいって\nいう、そんな……たわいもない……想い……。", "zh": "只是想靠近最喜欢的人们，想和他们建立联系，\n就是这样……微不足道的……心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
